@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 240
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF4FB
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #355777
skinparam ActorBorderColor #355777
skinparam ArrowColor #355777
hide footbox
autonumber
title Common button selects 10 unlearned bank words

' Sources: backend/app/api/routes/common_words.py and backend/app/services/common_words.py.
actor Learner
participant "Add a word screen" as Client
participant "Common batch API" as API
participant "Common practice service" as S
database PostgreSQL as DB

Learner -> Client : Click Common button
Client -> API : Request Common practice batch (authenticated)\nPOST /api/v1/common-words/batch
API -> S : Resolve active user; validate request
break Unauthenticated or account unavailable
  API --> Client : Authentication error; no selection or LLM call
end
S -> DB : Read user's learned common_word_ids\nfrom user_common_word_progress WHERE learned_at IS NOT NULL
DB --> S : Learned IDs
S -> S : selected = []; cursor = start of shared common_words bank
loop Until 10 distinct unlearned words selected OR bank exhausted
  S -> DB : Read next 10 common_words after cursor\nStable ID order; keyset pagination
  DB --> S : Up to 10 bank entries, or end of bank
  S -> S : Advance cursor past fetched page\nCompare with learned IDs; append only unlearned entries\nStop appending when selected contains 10 words
end
note over S, DB : Shared bank contains operator-generated vocabulary; its size is operator-selected.\nNo per-user word generation or bank refill job.\nLearned words are filtered before LLM generation.\nSaved-but-unlearned words remain eligible.
opt No words selected
  S -> DB : Check whether the shared bank contains any entries
  DB --> S : Bank available or empty
end
alt Shared bank is empty
  S --> API : CommonGenerationUnavailable
  API --> Client : 503; Common words are not available yet
else Populated bank has no unlearned words remaining
  S --> API : status=complete; questions=[]
  API --> Client : Show all Common words learned
else At least one unlearned word selected
  ref over S, DB : 23_common_words_worker: request-driven question generation\nGenerate and persist questions for the selected bank words
  alt Generation or validation fails
    S --> API : Retryable generation error; no partial batch persisted
    API --> Client : Show Retry; preserve existing learning progress
  else Valid batch persisted
    S --> API : Up to 10 owned question IDs, word details, prompts and four choices\nAnswer keys remain on backend
    API --> Client : Show one question at a time
    note over Client : Normal batch = exactly 10 unlearned words.\nIf fewer than 10 remain in the bank, show the smaller final batch.\nRequest another batch only when the learner chooses to continue.
  end
end
note over API, DB : Do not hold a database transaction open during the LLM request.\nRecheck active account and learned IDs before publishing the batch;\nif concurrent learning changed the selection, discard and rebuild it.\nAt most 3 selection/generation attempts within the Common timeout budget.

@enduml
